 ["The notice and the penalty decision are issued separately; several violations are set out separately in one notice","The notice and the penalty decision are merged into one document; several violations require separate notices each","The notice and the penalty decision are issued separately; only the most severely punished item is put in the notice","The authority may issue either one alone; several violations are listed together inside the penalty decision only"],
