 "第6條第2項：事業或污水下水道系統屬應設置廢水處理專責人員者，依第1項第1款、第2款但書及第3款檢具之文件，應經其所設置之專責人員確認；其水措計畫核准文件或許可證屬應經技師簽證者，功能測試報告書應經技師簽證。",
 "Who must confirm or countersign the proof documents for an enterprise required to appoint a wastewater treatment specialist?",
 ["The appointed specialist confirms them; where the permit requires engineer certification, so must the performance test report","The responsible person's seal suffices; the performance test report is countersigned on site by an assigned inspector","The industry competent authority stamps them; the performance test report is signed by the testing firm's sampling staff","An environmental group or local head witnesses them; the report is certified by the equipment supplier's engineer"],
